{"id":"baile","lemma":"baile","pos":"noun","rank":714,"glosses":["dance (a sequence of rhythmic steps or movements usually performed to music)","dance (a social gathering where dancing is the main activity)","ball (a formal dance)"],"ipa":"/ˈbaile/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"bailes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/43/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-baile.wav","examples":[{"text":"Voy a ir al baile.","en":"I'm going to the dance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/604799","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Quiero saber si irás conmigo al baile.","en":"I want to know if you'll go with me to the dance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1154846","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to know, to understand"},{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"with me"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"¿Quién es tu pareja de baile?","en":"Who is your dance partner?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"couple, pair"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"¿Conoces algún baile étnico?","en":"Do you know an ethnic dance?","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},null,null,{"g":"ethnic"}]},{"text":"Hubo un baile en nuestro centro.","en":"There was a dance at our club.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"our, ours, to us"},{"g":"center"}]}]}